build/
# Carve-out: esp_littlefs.[ch] gained a project-added esp_littlefs_gc()
# wrapper (see LITTLEFS_MIGRATION_NOTES.md) that the upstream component
# doesn't provide. managed_components/ is otherwise fetched/regenerated by
# the Component Manager and not meant to be tracked -- these two files are
# tracked specifically so a clean re-fetch (idf.py fullclean, fresh clone)
# doesn't silently drop the change. Re-apply by hand if the component's
# pinned version ever changes and these no longer apply cleanly.
# NOTE: must use "dir/*" (not "dir/") at every level for the "!" negations
# below to have any effect -- a plain "dir/" exclusion blocks re-inclusion
# of anything under it, full stop (git's documented behavior).
managed_components/*
!managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/
managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/*
!managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/include/
!managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/src/
managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/include/*
!managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/include/esp_littlefs.h
managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/src/*
!managed_components/joltwallet__littlefs/src/esp_littlefs.c
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
*.log
releases/
